<title>Myanmar's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/myanmar/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-myanmar-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military continues airstrikes, killing a pregnant woman in Mrauk-U and targeting schools in Sagaing, while resistance forces capture multiple outposts near the Sagaing-Kachin border and seize a key command headquarters. Drone attacks on the Tada-U airbase and a Christian Bible school in Karen State show expanding aerial tactics. Thailand placed ten border provinces on alert as cross-border fighting spreads, and the junta is courting U.S. rare-earth investment to reduce Chinese dependence, while China seeks green stones from Myanmar. The conflict has caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOeGRlYnlQbHM3T3hGeWNXdHpuWWNnejNxWmVnbE1UTE1QLXFTa1BKRW9UUTdZTTJiQkxPVXR4cldabHRzdW9GUl9MbjF3YmR6czB4MUhiVWd0WFJyNXBXdVZ5U2lJdkJVOHZTMWVBY3oxbUtId1UxdENLNUVPYW1iUE5ROEpITjN1SmEzcUhuQjNBbXNiRzFYc3AwMkVRRUNnVVRxSTNOOVVVUHl0V3pGNmFLYXIwOUZY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQZ3E4Q1E3akF1M01NSXRPUTJueHF3cTkyT1VOWlJUOHZOR1hPeFVuQkV2dVduQkV2VFA3bWJPUENWN1p2Wkcwb184YVhEYWFScnZkUUJudDZxMHVkeEhrMHc0VWFvcHhCN0h0LV85Z1k3ZTRPVkRaQ2ktVU42NHRYemg2cFNkTF9faVphS01UcWpuQnFhYm1YZmVsaWVpeUZnV0RTWXcyeTZSLTI4N0pBQjVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Centre for Information Resilience&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNLW1MVDNtb0xMT2pfZWF5THczMEY3akFCRFFCLS02VEM2MWp1dnVFTkdROWtGVFItRWRpRXAxalVYcUozYUF5Y2UxMVFpMHN6Z0gwYWpDWkxhZ1RQcG1aLXZzNnUtQlk1ZmhiS2E0TS1ROXBvVXpDbjNKRkI4NWw3UEZfd3Z4SEhDbGhhcHVkZ3RMVkhIQWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Myanmar Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPOGt6NlUxb1NidUZmaG0tOGRQdm80aFBxNWNVa3RtYWNoUjdoS29SVEVoM3lVbU9jbjI4VFhCbXg2eXVHdWRzT1VXS3RBQkJmYk9NNmRHSGlUUHZBNy1XZFUyUWYwTGFyRDZIMDVwU0o